> On 2/8/96 Tom Evans answered several FX!32 questions but it got me to 
> wondering if FX!32 will work on device drivers.  Will the converted 
> packages need Alpha drivers or will they be able to convert the Intel 
> ones to work on an Alpha?
     
FX!32 runs user mode 32bit x86 applications.  There is not
support for non-user mode software such as device drivers.
Be aware that FX!32 is an end user software package and
not an ISV porting tool, although an ISV might be able to
leverage additional license sales by shipping their x86
software with pre translated Alpha bits.

So, for the time being you need native drivers for your hardware
devices.

