To avoid over heating, you can 

(1)  decrease clock frequency. If you cannot do that by yourself,
you can ask for that to a dealer or a manufacturer. It should be quite simple.
For example, you can change dip switch position or jumper seting on your
motherboard.
(2)  add another fan.

Perhaps (1) is much easier.

If you doubt POWER SUPPLY CAPACITY, buy higher capacity Power Supply.

Hope this helps.

