>installed on my system.....

This is just a guess, but you left the 'Startup' of FTP, HTTP and Gopher
(you other ones) to 'Automatic' and when you rebooted - they restarted. The
reason why they tell you to shut down the other services is that http, for
instance monitors TCP port 80. Two seperate programs cannot monitor the same
port (it will let the first one monitor and the second one will get an error).

