When you brought the repaired machine back into the network, did 
you reinstall nt and give it the domain name?  If so, it creatd 
a new SID for the name and it won't match the old machines with 
the same name.  Instead, install nt and make it a backup domain 
controller in the old domain, then demote the other and promote 
the repaired machine to pdc.

