We have multi-gigabyte drives on our Alpha NT servers (20GB volume sets) with
usually around 3-5 GB free. All the DOS/WfWG clients report "2GB Free, 2GB
Total". This is a typical "signed int", -2^31 (-2GB) ... +2^31 (+2GB).

